# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Nexora Growth Partner PWA — environment template
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Copy to `.env.local` (dev) or set in your hosting provider's env config
# (Vercel / AI Studio secrets / CI). **Never** commit a real key.
#
# Variables starting with VITE_ are inlined into the browser bundle by Vite.
# Prefer server-side / serverless routes for any secret; only expose VITE_*
# values that are safe to ship to the client.

# --- AI assistance (optional) ---------------------------------------------
# Two ways to power AI copy assist:
#   1. SERVER-SIDE (recommended): deploy the serverless /api functions
#      (`/api/generate-bio`, `/api/improve-text`) and set GEMINI_API_KEY there.
#      The app calls these same-origin routes first.
#   2. CLIENT-SIDE FALLBACK: if the /api routes are unavailable, `src/lib/aiAssist.ts`
#      calls the Gemini REST API directly using VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY.
#      NOTE: a VITE_* key ships in the browser bundle — use a restricted/throwaway
#      key, or rely on the serverless route, in production.
GEMINI_API_KEY="MY_GEMINI_API_KEY"              # used only by the serverless /api routes
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=""                          # optional client-side fallback key

# APP_URL: The URL where this applet is hosted.
# AI Studio automatically injects this at runtime with the Cloud Run service URL.
# Used for self-referential links, OAuth callbacks, and API endpoints.
APP_URL="MY_APP_URL"

# --- Nexora Supabase (shared project qwaehqsmodekbgvnaavz) -----------------
# Supabase Dashboard → Project qwaehqsmodekbgvnaavz → Settings → API.
# The app refuses to boot against any other Supabase project.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://qwaehqsmodekbgvnaavz.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=PASTE_REAL_ANON_KEY_HERE

# --- Nexora universal auth storage key -------------------------------------
# The app pins its session storage to the shared Nexora key
# 'nexora.auth.qwaehqsmodekbgvnaavz' (PKCE + persistSession + autoRefresh +
# detectSessionInUrl). The constant is enforced in src/lib/supabase.ts; this
# line documents the value for ops and must never be changed to a different
# key, or cross-app session sharing would silently break.
VITE_SUPABASE_STORAGE_KEY=nexora.auth.qwaehqsmodekbgvnaavz
